<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · region</p><h1 class="enc-title">Democratic Republic of the Congo</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Democratic Republic of Congo</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Democratic <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/republic-of-the-congo">Republic of the Congo</a> is a large country in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/central-africa">Central Africa</a>. Its southern savanna, particularly the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/katanga">Katanga</a> region, was the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bantustan">homeland</a> of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/luba-empire">Luba Empire</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lunda-empire">Lunda Empire</a>, whose political traditions and influence spread widely across the region.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/democratic-republic-of-the-congo.jpg" alt="Democratic Republic of the Congo" width="320" height="240" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Nightstallion · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_Democratic_Republic_of_the_Congo.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
